{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "d56c0ae6b81c4061a1323c0edd9bc398c4e0f5b960f3a2712514fc41fedbf9a5", "ja": "星に焦がれて", "zh": "渴望群星", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2ade844e27f3918a5b9ed0973af3fd0869e1d644f8d54ddf3d6facef6e79b2dd", "ja": "レッスン初日。苦戦する雪歩の練習に付き合\nう貴音。休憩中、貴音のお茶やタオルを用意\nする雪歩。貴音はそんな雪歩の心配りに改め\nて感心する。雪歩も貴音の良い所を挙げる所\nに春香と伊織が合流し、レッスン再開。", "zh": "课程第一天。贵音陪着苦苦练习的雪步一起训练。\n休息时，雪步为贵音准备了茶和毛巾。贵音再次\n为雪步的体贴而感到佩服。雪步正要列举贵音的\n优点时，春香和伊织也加入进来，课程重新开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3366ad0d40f9688f2cbd9f158f9d4349fd440a30540a91c8e2581a4c48992b7b", "ja": "天体公演、レッスン初日……", "zh": "天体公演，第一天的课程……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "919598e6b567273ede78060bc1d99549a1770ae9cdf02d0991630740c6c608a2", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……うぅ、何度やっても遅れちゃう……。\n四条さんごめんなさい、付き合ってもらっちゃって。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……呜，无论练多少次还是会慢半拍……。\n四条同学，对不起，还让你陪我一起练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1d123cb0fb9819a1efcbe337a9a9e8aeda3bae9ad3cb9620785b1ad871affce6", "ja": "同じところの繰り返し……。\n四条さんは、もう覚えてるところばっかりなのに。", "zh": "一直在重复相同的地方……\n明明四条小姐全都已经记住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "f514dd75a6a677b6668a1f545524fc79f13638a1129d203fa326fae5cc89fef9", "ja": "いいえ、復習は大切なことです。私のためにも\nなっていますから、気にしないでくださいね、雪歩。", "zh": "不，温故而知新。这对我来说\n也是一种收获，请不要放在心上，雪步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c034db9ac8a619d4a5b9b9b284c464edc2e5353907903e14a07c0fed1bbbc5b8", "ja": "うぅ……でも、申し訳なくて。\nやっぱり四条さんは、休んでくれてても……。", "zh": "呜……可是，我还是觉得过意不去。\n四条同学果然还是去休息会比较……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "4cfd72c26fe1367a19dea857e4f5d2fd3ad3f64a51377ce96bf7d8d38a8bb290", "ja": "私なら大丈夫です。それより雪歩こそ、\n少し休憩した方がよいのではありませんか？", "zh": "我没关系的。比起这个，雪步才是，\n不是应该稍微休息一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6a8cc62dfd3b8c913b4d6e51ea861918902edf383d9ad9518a3a456e12891e4f", "ja": "こ、これくらいへっちゃらです……！\n四条さんが頑張ってくれてるのに、弱音はナシです！", "zh": "这、这点程度难不倒我……！\n四条小姐还在努力，我可不能说泄气话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "48c3dd9a45b81fc98dbda951b6494735ae424450bc806c3eaaa66d6128a30c49", "ja": "そうですか。では、もう少し合わせてみましょう。", "zh": "这样啊。那么，我们再配合练习一会儿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ec0c57509ece6a37a4f8e37f560a1f3f80d7f97107e16839674b87bcf89f81b3", "ja": "はい！　それじゃ、もう一度……。\nまずは、最初から通しで……お願いしますっ！", "zh": "好的！那就再来一次……先从头到尾完整地来一遍……拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ab9d79e90c53818afb9311d03f12e6b4ce6226446fdf97b5a124fb27269bc388", "ja": "は、はぁ、はぁ……な、なんとか覚えられました！\n四条さんのおかげですぅ！　やったぁ……♪", "zh": "哈、哈啊、哈啊……总、总算记住了！\n多亏了四条小姐！太好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "cddd6fdf15b3c8e6acd12000f950900d43d4747d98207c8ae28cd60e4952ce1a", "ja": "お見事です、萩原雪歩。あなたの努力の成果ですね。", "zh": "做得漂亮，萩原雪步。这就是你努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "366664a1216dc06e8a6b4c8f48a3c3f1bcb7bc4b301c1c2bec921549a2d23d48", "ja": "えへへ……四条さん、疲れてませんか？　四条さんの\n分のタオルも持ってきたので、使ってください。", "zh": "嘿嘿……四条小姐，你累不累？我也带了四条小姐的毛巾，请用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b9635040dee94ae2180bec5277e1354d32b0be370de449e907e78a00cf4d975c", "ja": "それと、お茶も淹れてきているので、\n一緒にどうですか？　お茶うけの塩昆布もあります！", "zh": "另外，我还泡了茶，要一起喝吗？还有下茶的盐昆布哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "9617de2ddeedfe572c4008eb34b426e00722c9b7386fab5299d8a2e75038448c", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nその細やかな気遣いには、いつも助けられます。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n您这份细致的体贴，总是帮了我大忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e56027108182d873551289d1cf6d6f0a9eced8e8627d70706b936e1a498b596a", "ja": "とんでもないですぅ！　私が四条さんのためにできる\nことなんて、これくらいしかありませんから……。", "zh": "没什么的啦！我能为四条小姐做的，也就只有这些了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "09dc3c39be801df50949c9c50bafbabccecda4123afbbf4c7bd4804e9b2c0f27", "ja": "これくらい、ですか……。", "zh": "就这么点吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1017_004yuk", "source_sha256": "07fda67dc641c809dff2d761340f0ac380d794efef961eba96540b81f7a9bba3", "ja": "？　四条さん？", "zh": "？四条小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "574b6db4e8600bb5be13c439561dfd4443c7fb7ac8a25b040917b01dbfb120ef", "ja": "雪歩。差し出がましいことを言いますが……\n私は思うのです。貴方は、素晴らしい方だと。", "zh": "雪步，或许我说这些有些多管闲事……但我认为，你是一位非常出色的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d65e65c9956de9a9015fa744358a3236c0867c09dd90766798f30bc5e92d1777", "ja": "ふぁっ！？", "zh": "啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "a6d8b5f1d096395f587e3a223bc48b9628f21f8eab99f4f1c80b3b11672d5c4b", "ja": "自分に余裕がない時でも、誰かを思いやれる……それは\n簡単なことではありません。自信を持つべきです。", "zh": "即使自己无暇顾及，也能体谅他人……这并不是件容易的事。您应该对自己有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9c87c76aed9457d386d6c4cc856f8512e1e1f4eff48caf9079a5bd847150f022", "ja": "あ、あわわ……！　四条さんにそんなふうに\n言ってもらえるなんて、ソワソワしちゃう……。", "zh": "啊、啊哇哇……！居然能听四条小姐那样说我，让我坐立不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f1477522f71c3eff537d2591e665b90441346d268652abce47898a2b4853db2c", "ja": "あ、あの、じゃあ私も！　四条さんの素晴らしい\nところ、言っちゃってもいいですか……？", "zh": "啊、那个，那我也来！我可以说说四条同学的优点吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "25f715a0903dd37d3b6b7746b7ad07fc83b5bb5b50d4176d33469e4a8cc33064", "ja": "え？　ええ……。なぜそうなったのか、いささか\n不可思議ですが……受けて立ちましょう。", "zh": "咦？　嗯……虽然不太明白为什么会变成这样……不过，我接受挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "423b46d559b36753ed4c2102edd4b53a887c7022a1eaf858ddb4059c0c94383e", "ja": "ありがとうございますぅ。えっと……\n四条さんは、本当に本当に本当に、素敵な人なんです！", "zh": "太感谢了呜。那个……\n四条小姐真的是、真的是、真的是个非常棒的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "35320f3eaa7d12703fe1559c40f38ff232cdbbce737abb06a35c89e700f4b40e", "ja": "完璧なスタイルと、完璧なパフォーマンスはもちろん、\nクールでミステリアスで、きれいで高貴な感じで……！", "zh": "完美的比例，和完美的表演就不用说了，\n又冷艳又神秘，既美丽又高贵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d6983405cfb73186a37aac9538923761630e62e2c7e01c0f440ba3c334ff6070", "ja": "お肌も透き通るみたいに、髪も長くていい匂いで、\nスンスンしたのは一度や二度じゃなくて……！", "zh": "皮肤也白皙透亮，头发又长又香，我可不止一次两次偷偷闻过了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0571159782a15700ec3d6dc5f1997ce0baf739df0a6ee8e30b9fb1121a0279c5", "ja": "でもでも、そんな四条さんが、かわいい衣装を着て\n踊ってる姿は、もっともっと最高ですぅ！", "zh": "但是但是，穿着可爱服装跳舞的四条小姐，比那样的四条小姐更加更加棒呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "b103f209b5c0cd74543a3fead114f71514885080a69f5babbf56e7607c25164c", "ja": "なる、ほど……？", "zh": "原来如此……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "946f142cc4bda975de675309b7e8fa6f684e289d4eee6af4a0347ef1bd251da0", "ja": "しかも、かわいい歌を歌い終わったら、\n恥ずかしそうに顔を赤らめたりもして～！", "zh": "而且，唱完可爱的歌后，还会害羞地红着脸呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1030_null", "source_sha256": "8b54693877ee97a09c9e25bb1b7c52bccb1efbad61749fe01c681d50081f43ce", "ja": "ガチャ……", "zh": "咔嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1031_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ec04ef1f7c8a827fd9464e0bc7d7b47cd1c9c95d3ed7169f673edbbf9b700368", "ja": "おまけに最後、照れ隠しで微笑んでくれたりもするから\nじつは私そのたびに「はう！」とか思ってるんですぅ！", "zh": "而且最后还会为了掩饰害羞对我微笑什么的，所以其实每次我都会在心里“呜哇！”一下呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1032_001har", "source_sha256": "271a3284ad2347fa713d03334692e9ba356dea0131bb2b4b0122f7bf7f64f9ae", "ja": "……。\nえっと、雪歩？", "zh": "……\n那个，雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "ad243a63fbabeee4af808c28ddf1a77473be720d8b25b4698b98b9e0ba5fc52e", "ja": "なんか……お邪魔かしら？", "zh": "怎么……我是不是打扰你们了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "802ebfbd483ec6c8afecc57422fa7e5fb6351a5c11b0e4a064d34acc88fe363f", "ja": "え、ええっ！？　春香ちゃん、伊織ちゃん！\nい、いつからそこに……え、えっと今のはその……！", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？春香、小伊织！\n什、什么时候来的……呃，那个，刚才的不是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1035_004yuk", "source_sha256": "835cfb0a2f5c793a15d4adaf6f3883c70e18ecf046d484678cd455ece8ec3e46", "ja": "照れ隠しって言うかお返しって言うか、\nただの私の妄想って言うか独り言っていうか、～～～！", "zh": "该说是为了掩饰害羞，还是作为回礼，或者说只是我的妄想，又或者只是自言自语，～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1036_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dc10d66fcc3e3ea53358f7c68dc94b44de8d1f6f1af71def59908285fa65f7cc", "ja": "とにかくごめんなさい～！　私もう生きていけない気が\nするから、ブラジルまで穴掘って埋まってますぅぅぅ！", "zh": "总之对不起～！我感觉自己已经没法活下去了，所以要挖个洞一直挖到巴西，把自己埋进去呜呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1037_007ior", "source_sha256": "4b2075fb39b9b12b602e507e490c38e644a62dd526b5c23c1eb1e7f187e182fc", "ja": "埋まってたらレッスンできないでしょ？　それで、\nどう？　私たちが居ない間に、かなり進んじゃった？", "zh": "埋进土里不就没办法练习了吗？话说，\n进展如何？在我们不在的时候，练得差不多了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1038_008tak", "source_sha256": "fc3bdf58b81ba75bd0230c7934f54e51fb43b6f015946d4a2a41d23b0cba6600", "ja": "ええ。私も雪歩も、振り付けを覚え終わったので、\n小休止といったところです。", "zh": "嗯。我和雪步都已经记完舞步了，现在正好休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1039_001har", "source_sha256": "1748726964aa8c7948e2dfa4e76ae4c86a2644db61a10af2ff3b308f6e2927d5", "ja": "えっ、ふたりとも、\nもう覚えちゃったんですか！？", "zh": "诶，你们两个都已经记住了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1040_007ior", "source_sha256": "46c8432df657deac767275d258309d874fef8150d9a7a79ba92e01fcda9939f0", "ja": "あら、やるじゃない。春香、私たちも負けて\nられないわよ、早く追いつかなきゃ！", "zh": "哎呀，挺能干的嘛。春香，我们可不能\n输给她们，得快点赶上才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "5b4108285fecee20af671ca6747b8e9fb9dc5584d8e3d02f326aa47128562c16", "ja": "そうだね、頑張らないと！\n2人が休んでる間に、ちょっとでも進めないとね。", "zh": "是啊，得加油才行！\n趁着2人在休息，我们也得尽量再往前推进一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1042_008tak", "source_sha256": "de492f467f3a305a606663938a5bec31777fbe1c41aae005649545d94290fe05", "ja": "そういうことでしたら、私達ももう少しだけ頑張って、\n4人で合わせたいところです。雪歩はどうですか？", "zh": "既然这样，我们也想再努力一下，争取让4个人一起合练。雪步觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c52212f8d7d705bbd51d90749bf8de93425bebbce629485194fe1fae1d13be30", "ja": "あ、わ、私も大丈夫ですぅ！　最初のうちに、\n感覚をつかんでおきたいので……。", "zh": "啊，我、我也没问题！我想趁一开始先掌握感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1044_001har", "source_sha256": "0810c29b3941409f8b4982cb5d3a1d5ff36867279f9562b537c1d02c73371e85", "ja": "わ、初日からすごいやる気……ふふっ。\nじゃあ、みんなでしよっか！", "zh": "哇，第一天就这么有干劲……呵呵。\n那大家就一起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1045_007ior", "source_sha256": "ecf477befbd833d5583d3e7ee09f41470e0ab7a92e4ebc8d90f4f0a7aed7b9fd", "ja": "全員揃う時間って、貴重だものね。\nそれじゃ、合わせてみましょう♪", "zh": "毕竟大家能到齐的时间很宝贵嘛。\n那么，就合练一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0357_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0357_story_02_1046_008tak", "source_sha256": "d59e01f99642a1f55457180b677ee8eb7a009b80834dbaa0b3771290c4e73051", "ja": "ええ、レッスンを再開いたしましょう。\nステラ、その名に相応しき輝きを目指して……いざ。", "zh": "好的，那就重新开始训练吧。\n为了追求与“斯特拉”之名相称的光辉……出发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
